          '<img src="1"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:02.114</font> Process <u>alpha</u> <font color="#1E8449">started</font>'
          '<img src="1"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:02.882</font> Process <u>bravo</u> <font color="#1E8449">started</font>'
          '<img src="0"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:03.401</font> Process <u>alpha</u> finished'
          '<img src="2"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:04.010</font> Process <u>charlie</u> <font color="#B7950B">halted</font>'
          '<img src="3"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:05.550</font> Process <u>bravo</u> <font color="#C0392B"><b>error</b></font> — disk full'
          '<img src="4"> <font color="#7F8C8D">09:14:06.117</font> Process <u>delta</u> retrying'
          'The icons come from <b>&lt;img src="n"&gt;</b> — index n of the Images list.'
          'Markup works here too: <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underline</u>, <s>strike</s>, <font bgcolor="#FBEEA8">highlight</font>, H<sub>2</sub>O, E=mc<sup>2</sup>.'
          'Links light up under the mouse — <a href="https://wiki.lazarus.freepascal.org/">the Lazarus wiki</a>.'
          '<font color="#7F8C8D">Press <b>Start log</b> to watch formatted lines arrive, the way the original demo did.</font>'
        )
